@startuml
title Spring Security OAuth2 Login (BFF + Keycloak)

actor Browser
participant "BFF\n(Spring Boot + Spring Security)" as BFF
participant "Keycloak\n(IdP)" as KC

== Initial Access ==

Browser -> BFF : GET /
activate BFF

note right of BFF
AuthorizationFilter
↓
anonymous user
↓
AccessDeniedException
end note

note right of BFF
ExceptionTranslationFilter
saves request in session
end note

BFF --> Browser : 302 Redirect\n/oauth2/authorization/keycloak
deactivate BFF

== OAuth Authorization Request ==

Browser -> BFF : GET /oauth2/authorization/keycloak
activate BFF

note right of BFF
OAuth2AuthorizationRequestRedirectFilter
creates:
- state
- nonce
- redirect_uri
end note

BFF --> Browser : 302 Redirect to Keycloak\n/auth?...&state=...&nonce=...
deactivate BFF

== User Login ==

Browser -> KC : GET /auth
activate KC

KC --> Browser : Login Page

Browser -> KC : POST credentials

note right of KC
User authentication
end note

KC --> Browser : 302 Redirect\n/login/oauth2/code/keycloak?code=...&state=...
deactivate KC

== OAuth Callback ==

Browser -> BFF : GET /login/oauth2/code/keycloak\n?code=...&state=...
activate BFF

note right of BFF
OAuth2LoginAuthenticationFilter
validates:
- state
- authorization response
end note

== Token Exchange ==

BFF -> KC : POST /token\n(code → access token)
activate KC

KC --> BFF : access_token\nid_token\nrefresh_token
deactivate KC

== OIDC Validation ==

BFF -> KC : GET /certs
activate KC
KC --> BFF : JWK Set
deactivate KC

note right of BFF
Validate ID Token signature
and nonce
end note

== UserInfo ==

BFF -> KC : GET /userinfo
activate KC

KC --> BFF : user claims
deactivate KC

== Session Login ==

note right of BFF
Create Authentication
Store SecurityContext
Rotate Session ID
end note

BFF --> Browser : Set-Cookie: JSESSIONID\n302 Redirect /
deactivate BFF

== Authenticated Access ==

Browser -> BFF : GET /
activate BFF

note right of BFF
SecurityContext restored
from session
end note

BFF --> Browser : 200 OK\nUser JSON / HTML
deactivate BFF

@enduml